rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/04/from-warning-to-listing-uk-s-largest-wealth-platform-opens-access-to-crypto-etns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">From warning to listing: UK\u2019s largest retail investment platform opens access to crypto ETNs</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
